      {
        "id": 206421,
        "name": "QuirkyDM",
        "username": "QuirkyDM",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-17T17:37:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I also tried the unlock condition except in Magmaria. No unlock.</p><p>I don't think the bounties search is moot. We've seen conditions with bounties being played on villain targets and then being destroyed and that appears to have prevented the unlock. But playing bounties on Ambuscade is allowed, as has been shown in other unlocks. We might not have figured out the exact conditions of playing or destroying bounties that causes the unlock. A more precise definition of this requirement may still need to be defined.</p><p>That being said, there may be other variables we haven't hit yet. But I don't know what other options to pursue.</p>",
        "post_number": 171,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:35:54.265Z",
