        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-17T18:51:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Try 1: Ambuscade on Wagner with no Tachyon. Chrono only drew cards and discarded for an oxygen leak. No unlock.</p><p>Try 2: Unlock. Used Tachyon, specifically made sure Chrono killed lots of villain targets, but not Ambuscade, only Bounty played was on Ambuscade. Log attached.</p><p>Sorry, that probably wasn't too much help. D:</p>",
