        "created_at": "2017-10-17T18:56:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The community has discovered the official unlock condition for Chrono-Ranger: Best of Times!</p><p><strong>Win a game against Ambuscade in the Wagner Mars Base with any versions of Tachyon and Chrono-Ranger on the team. Tachyon must not be incapacitated. Chrono-Ranger must not play any bounties on targets other than Ambuscade. Neither Tachyon nor Chrono-Ranger may deal the final blow to Ambuscade.</strong></p>",
