        "name": "QuirkyDM",
        "username": "QuirkyDM",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-17T21:02:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Getting all 3 sizes in one turn is pretty trivial to pull off. It could be as tough as Hunted Naturalist- beat 3 different villains in 3 different sizes.</p><p>And heaven help us if we have to face Kaargra.</p>",
