        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-17T23:33:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think that the best part of the solution is the specification that&nbsp;you can use any version of Chrono Ranger for the unlock.&nbsp; Meaning, you can use Best of Times Chrono Ranger to unlock Best of Times Chrono Ranger.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Assuming you can somehow time travel, that is.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
